BugInfo.Description:
当类实现了Externalizable接口，但是没有定义无参构造方法时，当此类对象被反序列化时，首先需要通过调用无参构造函数来构造。当这个类没有时，会抛出InvalidClassException并失败。  

**例如**：下面代码示例中，类实现了Externalizable接口，没有定义无参构造方法。  
```java
public class User implements Externalizable {  
    private String name;  
    private int age;  
    ...  
    User (String name,int age) {  
        this.name = name;  
        this.age = age;  
        ...  
    }  
    @Override  
    public void writeExternal(ObjectOutput out) throws IOException {  
        ...  
    }  

    @Override  
    public void readExternal(ObjectInput in) throws IOException, ClassNotFoundException {  
        ...  
    }  
}
```

BugInfo.Advice:
当类实现了Externalizable接口，添加无参构造方法时。  

**例如**：下面代码示例中，类实现了Externalizable接口，定义了无参构造方法。  
```java
public class User implements Externalizable {  
    private String name;  
    private int age;  
    ...  
    User (){}  
    User (String name,int age) {  
        this.name = name;  
        this.age = age;  
        ...  
    }  
    @Override  
    public void writeExternal(ObjectOutput out) throws IOException {  
        ...  
    }  

    @Override  
    public void readExternal(ObjectInput in) throws IOException, ClassNotFoundException {  
        ...  
    }  
}
```
